  Game:       Plunder [PVP]          (game.Name reports 'Ugc'; title supplied by the user)
  Place IDs:  85646026816836
  Version:    v1.3
  Features:   player ESP, item ESP (cleaned names, coins ignored), container/safe ESP with lock state
  Controls:   menu tab "Plunder PVP"; toggles plus two sliders
  Needs:      Matcha Pro (UI + Drawing)
  Confirmed:  players are Workspace Models named R15Rig carrying a numeric 'userid' attribute
  Confirmed:  local UserId is 2251313101; NPC rigs carry a negative 'userid'
  Confirmed:  Model:GetBoundingBox and GetExtentsSize are nil, so the box uses Head + HumanoidRootPart
  Confirmed:  items live in Workspace.GameSystem.WorldItem (35-42 children, Tools and Models, live count)
  Confirmed:  containers live in Workspace.GameArea.SpaceCenter.Container (160 children, 20 kinds)
  Confirmed:  v1.1 looked for Workspace.GameScene.Container, which does not exist - the toggle drew
