  Confirmed:  the container folder is intermittent (PATH true, then PATH false minutes later with
              identical code) - treated as "area not loaded", not a wrong path
  Confirmed:  containers carry SafeLocked / ContainerOpened / ContainerCid attributes
  Confirmed:  WorldItem children have NO BillboardGui/TextLabel/StringValue at any depth (walked to
